  <div data-area="B-D" data-layout data-wa-component="Page Data">
    <h1>Security for your money</h1>
    

  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-wa-component="Breadcrumb">
    <ol  class="breadcrumb">
          <li  class="breadcrumb__item">
                  <a  class="breadcrumb__link" href="/en">Home</a>
              </li>
          <li  class="breadcrumb__item">
                  <a  class="breadcrumb__link" href="/en/about-us">About us</a>
              </li>
          <li  class="breadcrumb__item">
                  <a  class="breadcrumb__link" href="/en/about-us/nordea-in-society">Nordea in society</a>
              </li>
          <li  class="breadcrumb__item" aria-current="page">
                  Security for your money
              </li>
        </ol>
  </nav>

  </div>





          <div data-area="B"  data-layout="justify general:general" id="content" >
      <section class="collection layout--onecol" data-layout="" data-theme="">
                




    



  


    
        
              
                  
    



  
  


  
<article  class="card-article promoted-rtl" data-wa-template="Magazine card single - 1, N [C] " data-wa-component="Magazine card single">
              <picture
   class="image"
>
  <img
              src="/sites/default/files/styles/article_promoted_teaser/public/2024-11/young-women-looking-at-phone.jpg.webp?itok=WeryBGwp"
      alt=""
                      loading="eager"
      />

</picture>
      
  
  
    
    
  
            <h2 id="article-6ac736b6da67b" >
          We take the <span class="strong">next steps</span> for your sake
  </h2>
          
            
<p  class="standfirst">
      Developing our systems, that is, our payment systems, apps and online bank that our customers use every day is our top priority. We develop the systems to constantly meet our customers’ needs and changed behavior. Also, we protect against cyber attacks, detect fraud and generally safeguard our customers from financial crime.
  </p>
      
    </article>
    

      </section>
    </div>
      

          <div data-area="B"  data-layout="center" >
      <section class="collection layout--onecol" data-layout="" data-theme="">
                
  




<div  class="rte" data-wa-component="Text" data-wa-template="Text - 1, C [C]">

  
  
  
<div class="rte">
      
<div class="rte">
  <p>Keeping our customers safe is the core of what we do, and we are prepared for a wide range of situations. We have very strong defence mechanisms, and in recent years we have <a href="/en/about-us/nordea-in-society/monitoring-customers-and-transactions" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a744afab-1870-4a5a-8925-c47fca2fb600" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Monitoring customers and transactions">invested </a>in numerous areas both when it comes to upskilling people and our capacity to keep improving our systems on an ongoing basis.&nbsp;</p><p>We are a frontrunner in digital banking in the Nordics, <a href="https://www.nordea.com/en/news/our-digital-channels-recognised-as-the-best-in-the-nordics-once-again">being awarded for our services.</a> Today, more than 5 million customers are actively using our app and online bank: 25% more than in early 2022.</p>
</div>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="block block-layout-builder block-inline-block-spacer">
  
  
      
<div class="block-content block-content--type-spacer block-content--62396 block-content--view-mode-full">
  
  
  <div class="block-content__content">
      <div class="block-spacer block-spacer-10">&nbsp;</div>


  </div>
</div>

  </div>

      </section>
    </div>
      

          <div data-area="B"  data-layout="justify"  >
      <section class="collection layout--twocol" data-layout="lg:sm" data-theme="">
      
              <div >
          

  

  

  
        
<div class="block block-layout-builder block-inline-block-image position-">
  
  
  <div class="image-wrapper">
          <picture
   class="image with-caption"
>
  <img
              src="/sites/default/files/styles/full_image/public/2022-05/Mobile-Mockups-May-2022.jpg.webp?itok=c7p_y6Ok"
      alt=""
                      loading="eager"
      />

</picture>
      </div>
</div>

        </div>
      
              <div >
          
<div class="block block-layout-builder block-inline-block-spacer">
  
  
      
<div class="block-content block-content--type-spacer block-content--62376 block-content--view-mode-full">
  
  
  <div class="block-content__content">
      <div class="block-spacer block-spacer-50">&nbsp;</div>


  </div>
</div>

  </div>



    


  
  

<div  class="block">
  
  
       <section class="collection fact "
       >
                         <article data-wa-template="Factcard - 2, 67%/33%, N [C] number" data-wa-component="Factcard" class="card-article fact
                                       "
                        type="number"
                        data-theme=""
               >
                                                                                  <p class="number">4.5</p>
                                                     
<p  class="standfirst">
      This is the average rating for our app in App Store and Google Play.
  </p>
                                     </article>
         



  </section>

  </div>

        </div>
            </section>
    </div>
      

          <div data-area="B"  data-layout="center" >
      <section class="collection layout--onecol" data-layout="" data-theme="">
                
  
<div  class="block quote-wrapper">



<section class="quotes large  " data-theme="white">
  
<blockquote
   class="blockquote"
>

      

  <p>We have strong defences and we are continuously strengthening these further.</p>

    
      <footer><p>Marc Hofmann, Chief Security Officer.</p></footer>
  </blockquote>

  </section>




</div>

<div class="block block-layout-builder block-inline-block-spacer">
  
  
      
<div class="block-content block-content--type-spacer block-content--62401 block-content--view-mode-full">
  
  
  <div class="block-content__content">
      <div class="block-spacer block-spacer-10">&nbsp;</div>


  </div>
</div>

  </div>

      </section>
    </div>
      

          <div data-area="B"  data-layout="justify" >
      <section class="collection layout--onecol" data-layout="" data-theme="">
                  <header>
          <h2  >
          Staying one step ahead
  </h2>
          </header>
                
  




<div  class="rte" data-wa-component="Text" data-wa-template="Text - 1, N [C]">

  
  
  
<div class="rte">
      
<div class="rte">
  <ul><li>Algorithms and other processes are developed to monitor our customers’ more than 3.6bn transactions every year. These algorithms are here to detect patterns and protect customers.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</li><li>3,000 colleagues are dedicated solely to <a href="https://www.nordea.com/en/about-us/nordea-in-society/monitoring-customers-and-transactions">preventing financial crime</a>, but working with securing the bank is what all of us at Nordea are doing. We have three lines of defense, from the colleagues working directly with customers to the board that is deciding on the guidelines and frameworks. &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The systems we develop are the supporting backbone, the walls in the bank vault you might say, and we continue to update this system on a regular basis. We invest continuously in technology, AI and data each year.<br>&nbsp;</li><li>We will act upon all forms of actual threats, and customers and employees can rest assured that we have processes in place to respond to a wide range of exceptional circumstances and IT incidents. Since we operate <a href="https://www.nordea.com/en/about-us/who-are-we/our-markets">throughout the Nordics</a>, we are in a good position to protect our customers by being able to detect new patterns in all four countries.</li></ul>
</div>
  </div>

</div>

      </section>
    </div>
      

          <div data-area="B"  data-layout="center" >
      <section class="collection layout--onecol" data-layout="" data-theme="">
                
<div class="block block-layout-builder block-inline-block-spacer">
  
  
      
<div class="block-content block-content--type-spacer block-content--62421 block-content--view-mode-full">
  
  
  <div class="block-content__content">
      <div class="block-spacer block-spacer-20">&nbsp;</div>


  </div>
</div>

  </div>

      </section>
    </div>
      

          <div data-area="B"  data-layout="justify"  >
      <section class="collection layout--twocol" data-layout="md:md" data-theme="">
      
              <div >
          

  

  

  
        
<div class="block block-layout-builder block-inline-block-image position-">
  
  
  <div class="image-wrapper">
          <picture
   class="image with-caption"
>
  <img
              src="/sites/default/files/styles/full_image/public/2024-11/family-sitting-looking-at-phone.jpg.webp?itok=f7LNVuxJ"
      alt=""
                      loading="lazy"
      />

</picture>
      </div>
</div>

        </div>
      
              <div >
          
  



  
<div  class="rte" data-wa-component="Text" data-wa-template="Text - 2, 50%/50%, N [C]">

  
  
  
<div class="rte">
      
<div class="rte">
  <p>When did banking go digital? Our app is now,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.nordea.com/en/news/10-years-with-the-bank-in-your-phone-we-celebrate-a-digital-anniversary">over 10 years old</a>&nbsp;and it was created after closely following our customers behavior. Customers wanted a simple, convenient and secure platform to complete their daily banking activities. Since then, it has evolved – not least thanks to&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://www.nordea.com/en/news/our-mobile-bank-just-got-a-major-update-based-on-user-feedback">user feedback</a>.&nbsp;<br><br>As we continue updating our features, apps and systems we see great app ratings and also increased numbers of users of our digital services.&nbsp;Users can also leave feedback via the Help icon in the app directly.&nbsp;</p><p>People always come first for us, and we have developed fast ways to run meetings and chats with a personal adviser – all via our online bank or mobile banking app. Choosing to meet us online is becoming more and more popular each year. &nbsp;</p>
</div>
  </div>

</div>

        </div>
            </section>
    </div>
      

          <div data-area="B"  data-layout="center" >
      <section class="collection layout--onecol" data-layout="" data-theme="">
                


    



  

<div  class="block">
  
  
       <section class="collection fact "
       >
                         <article data-wa-template="Factcard - 1, C [C] counter" data-wa-component="Factcard" class="card-article fact
                                       "
                        type="counter"
                        data-theme="p1"
               >
                                                    <h3  >
          In our drive to develop our digital services we ask the users for input and
  </h3>
                                                        <div class="counter">
                  <p class="number" aria-hidden="true"><span data-count-from="0" data-count-to="45.000">0</span></p>
                  <p class="sr-only">45.000</p>
                </div>
                                                     
<p  class="standfirst">
      is the number of feedback comments that users gave us last year from all sources. 14 per cent of these suggestions have so far led to the development of features.
  </p>
                                     </article>
         



  </section>

  </div>

<div class="block block-layout-builder block-inline-block-spacer">
  
  
      
<div class="block-content block-content--type-spacer block-content--62426 block-content--view-mode-full">
  
  
  <div class="block-content__content">
      <div class="block-spacer block-spacer-20">&nbsp;</div>


  </div>
</div>

  </div>

      </section>
    </div>
      

          <div data-area="B"  data-layout="justify"  >
      <section class="collection layout--twocol" data-layout="md:md" data-theme="">
      
              <div >
          


    


  


  



  






  
  


  
<article  class="card-article plain-cta title-align-- link-align-- card-align--left" data-theme="p3" data-wa-template="Content Card - 2, 50%/50%, N [C] p3" data-wa-component="Content Card - single">
              <picture
