            <h3 id="article-6ac736b6e8653" >
          Settings for your sake
  </h3>
        
            

  <p>We have built in different ways for customers to&nbsp;customise settings to further tighten the security and get more control over both accounts and money:&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>Block your card fast.</li>
<li>Open and close your card for online shopping.</li>
<li>Geo-block your card: you decide in which countries your card may be used.</li>
<li>Set up restrictions for foreign and large transactions.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Get automated notifications about suspicious transactions.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Secure logins.</li>
</ul>


      
    </article>


        </div>
      
              <div >
          


    


  


  



  






  
  


  
<article  class="card-article plain-cta title-align--left link-align--left card-align--left" data-theme="p3" data-wa-template="Content Card - 2, 50%/50%, N [C] p3" data-wa-component="Content Card - single">
              <picture
   class="image"
>
  <img
              src="/sites/default/files/styles/article_promoted_teaser/public/2023-11/man-holding-phone-smiling.jpg.webp?itok=352IFEEk"
      alt=""
                      loading="lazy"
      />

</picture>
      
  
  
    
    
  
            <h3 id="article-6ac736b6eab90" >
          Did you know…
  </h3>
        
            

  <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;... we have offered ApplePay and GooglePay since 2018?</p>
<p>... we got the Global Retail Banker “IT Innovation of the Year” award back in 2017? We have continued to receive awards for our digital services; the latest was from Global Finance for Best consumer digital bank in Western Europe 2025.&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;... we started our<a href="https://openapi.portal.nordea.com/" target="_blank">&nbsp;investments in API technology</a>&nbsp;already in 2015 when we started to build a commercial API platform for open APIs.</p>


      
    </article>


        </div>
            </section>
    </div>
      

